hs disclosed by the current BCR staging manifest"}, {"Name": "StagedOnly", "Type": "SwitchParameter", "Mandatory": false, "Default": "", "Description": "Commit only the existing staged review manifest; do not stage other live worktree paths"}]', '["AdminMode.psm1", "ProposalManager.psm1", "Module: (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot ''..\\modules\\LcmPackageVersion.psm1'')"]', '2026-11-13 15:41:21', '2026-11-13 15:41:21');
